---
// src/components/SondaSection.astro
---

<section class="section sonda-section" id="sonda">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sonda-inner">

      <!-- Left: content -->
      <div class="sonda-content fade-in">

        <span class="section-label">Open-source project</span>

        <!-- Title with SONDA acronym highlighted -->
        <h2 class="sonda-title">
          <span class="sonda-acronym-line">
            <span class="sonda-letter">S</span><span class="sonda-word">olana</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sonda-acronym-line">
            <span class="sonda-letter">O</span><span class="sonda-word">bservatory for</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sonda-acronym-line">
            <span class="sonda-letter">N</span><span class="sonda-word">etwork</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sonda-acronym-line">
            <span class="sonda-letter">D</span><span class="sonda-word">ecentralization</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sonda-acronym-line">
            <span class="sonda-letter">A</span><span class="sonda-word">nalysis</span>
          </span>
        </h2>

        <p class="sonda-desc">
          Back in 2023, while choosing a datacenter for Solya, we ran into a
          problem: geolocation data was inconsistent across every tool we checked
          — the same validator IP showing different countries depending on the source.
          But it wasn't just about accuracy. We wanted to understand which
          datacenters were already overloaded with stake, and which regions
          were genuinely underserved. So we wrote a script to find out.
          Then kept going.
        </p>

        <p class="sonda-desc">
          SONDA now collects data across the full validator set, cross-verifies
          it from multiple geo sources, and calculates the metrics that actually
          matter for understanding how decentralized Solana really is.
          Open source, free to use, built for the whole ecosystem.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature list -->
        <ul class="sonda-features">
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>Multi-source geolocation with cross-verification and discrepancy detection</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>Decentralization metrics: Nakamoto Coefficient, HHI, Gini, Shannon Entropy</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>DoubleZero device mapping with protocol-verified geo overrides</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>Jito BAM endpoint monitoring and IBRL performance metrics per validator</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>Datacenter and ASN analysis — who controls what, and how much</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>Endpoint reachability monitoring across Jito, Harmonic, and Solana infrastructure</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sonda-feature">
            <span class="sonda-feature-icon">⊕</span>
            <span>All three clusters: mainnet-beta, testnet, devnet</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <!-- CTAs -->
        <div class="sonda-ctas">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/SolyaUk/sonda"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-primary"
          >
            View on GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://sonda.network"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-secondary sonda-network-btn"
            title="Dashboard in development"
          >
            <span class="sonda-dot"></span>
            sonda.network
            <span class="sonda-soon-tag">beta soon</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right: dashboard preview -->
      <div class="sonda-preview fade-in">
        <div class="sonda-preview-card">

          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="sonda-preview-header">
            <div class="sonda-preview-header-left">
              <span class="sonda-preview-dot sonda-preview-dot--red"></span>
              <span class="sonda-preview-dot sonda-preview-dot--yellow"></span>
              <span class="sonda-preview-dot sonda-preview-dot--green"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="sonda-preview-title">sonda.network · mainnet-beta</span>
            <span class="badge badge-magenta">preview</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Cluster summary row -->
          <div class="sonda-summary-row">
            <div class="sonda-summary-item">
              <span class="sonda-summary-value">800</span>
              <span class="sonda-summary-label">validators</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sonda-summary-item">
              <span class="sonda-summary-value">4,975</span>
              <span class="sonda-summary-label">gossip nodes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sonda-summary-item">
              <span class="sonda-summary-value">94</span>
              <span class="sonda-summary-label">endpoints</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sonda-summary-item">
              <span class="sonda-summary-value">95</span>
              <span class="sonda-summary-label">DZ devices</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Decentralization metrics -->
          <div class="sonda-metrics-block">
            <div class="sonda-metrics-label">Decentralization metrics</div>
            <div class="sonda-metrics-grid">
              <div class="sonda-metric-row">
                <span class="sonda-metric-name">Nakamoto (country)</span>
                <div class="sonda-metric-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-metric-bar" style="width: 38%"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="sonda-metric-val">—</span>
              </div>
              <div class="sonda-metric-row">
                <span class="sonda-metric-name">Nakamoto (ASN)</span>
                <div class="sonda-metric-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-metric-bar" style="width: 22%"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="sonda-metric-val">—</span>
              </div>
              <div class="sonda-metric-row">
                <span class="sonda-metric-name">Gini coefficient</span>
                <div class="sonda-metric-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-metric-bar sonda-metric-bar--warn" style="width: 71%"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="sonda-metric-val">—</span>
              </div>
              <div class="sonda-metric-row">
                <span class="sonda-metric-name">Shannon entropy</span>
                <div class="sonda-metric-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-metric-bar sonda-metric-bar--good" style="width: 58%"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="sonda-metric-val">—</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Geo distribution snippet -->
          <div class="sonda-geo-block">
            <div class="sonda-metrics-label">Top stake concentration</div>
            <div class="sonda-geo-rows">
              <div class="sonda-geo-row">
                <span class="sonda-geo-flag">🇺🇸</span>
                <span class="sonda-geo-name">United States</span>
                <div class="sonda-geo-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-geo-bar" style="width: 62%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="sonda-geo-row">
                <span class="sonda-geo-flag">🇩🇪</span>
                <span class="sonda-geo-name">Germany</span>
                <div class="sonda-geo-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-geo-bar" style="width: 11%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="sonda-geo-row">
                <span class="sonda-geo-flag">🇳🇱</span>
                <span class="sonda-geo-name">Netherlands</span>
                <div class="sonda-geo-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-geo-bar" style="width: 7%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="sonda-geo-row sonda-geo-row--highlight">
                <span class="sonda-geo-flag">🇧🇷</span>
                <span class="sonda-geo-name">Brazil</span>
                <div class="sonda-geo-bar-wrap">
                  <div class="sonda-geo-bar sonda-geo-bar--cyan" style="width: 3%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="sonda-preview-note">
            Values shown are illustrative. Live data at sonda.network — in development.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>